# The pkl is compiled on-device at first boot (see ../SConscript) — never
# commit it: it embeds tinygrad JIT kernels for one exact revision and goes
# stale on every tinygrad bump. The ONNX source IS committed (weights are
# pin-stable); regenerate the pkl with compile_yolo_onnx.py.
yolo_tinygrad.pkl
yolo_tinygrad.pkl.chunk*
yolo_tinygrad.pkl.tinygrad_pin
*.onnx.data
